    <description>REV-57: when a PFC has a Campaign and a linked Lead/Contact, add that person to the campaign as a member with status &quot;Registered&quot;. Deduped (skips if already a member) and fail-open (dup/insert faults logged via PFC_Log_Fault). Shared by newsfeed (campaign stamped by orchestrator) and inbound (campaign stamped by On_Pardot_Form_Creation).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>PFC Add Campaign Member {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>PFC Add Campaign Member</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
